WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.500
An application also shows whether its HR notification was delivered.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:11.219
Use Resend HR email when needed; an available CV is included with that email.

00:00:11.269 --> 00:00:15.452
Deleting an application removes its notes and CV as well,

00:00:15.502 --> 00:00:18.200
so review the confirmation carefully.
